<title>SPAIN: Telefonica expects to get US partner in 4-6 weeks.</title>
<headline>Telefonica expects to get US partner in 4-6 weeks.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Telefonica is in talks with nearly all the U.S. telecoms operators with a view to forming an alliance which should be announced within the next four to six weeks, chairman Juan Villalonga said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
